    "detailed_description": "<h1>COMMUNITY</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1832780/extras/a1c4824901981053c56ecd65a373b45a.avif?t=1746651692\" /></div><br>Welcome to Seven Cities, the urban action RPG set in a near-future New York City. In a world divided by corporate greed and technological advancement, you, an Outsider, must rise to reclaim the city and restore unity among its inhabitants. Prepare to experience a dynamic blend of modern urban environments, intense combat, and deep character customization.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customization and Gameplay:</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1832780/extras/3b5b10de1c5ff9f36625a5ab27d647bb.poster.avif?t=1746651692\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1832780/extras/3b5b10de1c5ff9f36625a5ab27d647bb.webm?t=1746651692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1832780/extras/3b5b10de1c5ff9f36625a5ab27d647bb.mp4?t=1746651692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Weapon Specializations: Choose from hundreds of weapon specializations to create a unique and devastating arsenal.<br></li><li>Tech Skills: Use technology-based skills to dominate your enemies, with holographic attacks and hacking abilities.<br></li><li>Robot Companion: Equip and customize your faithful robot with active and passive abilities to assist you in your mission.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1832780/extras/5a4ddfe2fcf3ab9e58198da61f3ee368.poster.avif?t=1746651692\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1832780/extras/5a4ddfe2fcf3ab9e58198da61f3ee368.webm?t=1746651692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1832780/extras/5a4ddfe2fcf3ab9e58198da61f3ee368.mp4?t=1746651692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Exploration and Immersion:</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1832780/extras/243ae8f1104e7d85a91a44b3f783f431.poster.avif?t=1746651692\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1832780/extras/243ae8f1104e7d85a91a44b3f783f431.webm?t=1746651692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1832780/extras/243ae8f1104e7d85a91a44b3f783f431.mp4?t=1746651692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A Living World: Explore varied urban environments, from dark alleys to shimmering skyscrapers, each with its own challenges and secrets.<br></li><li>Quests and Missions: Take on epic challenges, battle imposing bosses, and uncover the truth behind the division of the Seven Cities.<br></li><li>Holograms and Digital Realities: Immerse yourself in a world where reality blends with simulation through stunning visual effects.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Prepare for an Epic Adventure:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Regular Updates: Enjoy frequent updates with new weapons, skills, missions, and more.<br></li><li>Early Access: Be among the first to play and shape the future of Seven Cities by participating in our early access in october.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiplayer and Community:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Online Co-op: Team up with friends or join other players to tackle the challenges of the Seven Cities together. (We are actively working on the multiplayer that should be available during 2025)<br></li><li>Seasonal Events: Participate in regular events and unlock exclusive content throughout the year.<br></li><li>Community Support: Join our Discord to share feedback, discuss strategies, and stay updated with the latest game news.<br></li><li></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1832780/extras/a1c4824901981053c56ecd65a373b45a.avif?t=1746651692\" /></div><br>Welcome to Seven Cities, the urban action RPG set in a near-future New York City. In a world divided by corporate greed and technological advancement, you, an Outsider, must rise to reclaim the city and restore unity among its inhabitants. Prepare to experience a dynamic blend of modern urban environments, intense combat, and deep character customization.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customization and Gameplay:</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1832780/extras/3b5b10de1c5ff9f36625a5ab27d647bb.poster.avif?t=1746651692\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1832780/extras/3b5b10de1c5ff9f36625a5ab27d647bb.webm?t=1746651692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1832780/extras/3b5b10de1c5ff9f36625a5ab27d647bb.mp4?t=1746651692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Weapon Specializations: Choose from hundreds of weapon specializations to create a unique and devastating arsenal.<br></li><li>Tech Skills: Use technology-based skills to dominate your enemies, with holographic attacks and hacking abilities.<br></li><li>Robot Companion: Equip and customize your faithful robot with active and passive abilities to assist you in your mission.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1832780/extras/5a4ddfe2fcf3ab9e58198da61f3ee368.poster.avif?t=1746651692\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1832780/extras/5a4ddfe2fcf3ab9e58198da61f3ee368.webm?t=1746651692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1832780/extras/5a4ddfe2fcf3ab9e58198da61f3ee368.mp4?t=1746651692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Exploration and Immersion:</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1832780/extras/243ae8f1104e7d85a91a44b3f783f431.poster.avif?t=1746651692\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1832780/extras/243ae8f1104e7d85a91a44b3f783f431.webm?t=1746651692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1832780/extras/243ae8f1104e7d85a91a44b3f783f431.mp4?t=1746651692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A Living World: Explore varied urban environments, from dark alleys to shimmering skyscrapers, each with its own challenges and secrets.<br></li><li>Quests and Missions: Take on epic challenges, battle imposing bosses, and uncover the truth behind the division of the Seven Cities.<br></li><li>Holograms and Digital Realities: Immerse yourself in a world where reality blends with simulation through stunning visual effects.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Prepare for an Epic Adventure:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Regular Updates: Enjoy frequent updates with new weapons, skills, missions, and more.<br></li><li>Early Access: Be among the first to play and shape the future of Seven Cities by participating in our early access in october.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiplayer and Community:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Online Co-op: Team up with friends or join other players to tackle the challenges of the Seven Cities together. (We are actively working on the multiplayer that should be available during 2025)<br></li><li>Seasonal Events: Participate in regular events and unlock exclusive content throughout the year.<br></li><li>Community Support: Join our Discord to share feedback, discuss strategies, and stay updated with the latest game news.<br></li><li></li></ul>",
